        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  老陈。你以为你在做什么？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "老陈。你以为你在做什么？"
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  两年前在下水，你自己去追的匪首。我腿脚受了伤，但你很信任我，你留下我一个人战斗。你还记得吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "两年前在下水，你自己去追的匪首。我腿脚受了伤，但你很信任我，你留下我一个人战斗。你还记得吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  那次我追了他多长时间？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "那次我追了他多长时间？"
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  三个小时。你可以信任我。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "三个小时。你可以信任我。"
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
